# TDL / Nova Notes environment variables
#
#   backend/.env  -> PORT, MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET, JWT_EXPIRES_IN,
#                    AUTH_RATE_LIMIT_MAX, GEMINI_API_KEY, GEMINI_MODEL
#
# The frontend needs no environment variables: it calls the backend through the
# relative /api path and stores its login token in localStorage.
#
# Copy backend/.env.example to backend/.env and fill it in.
# This root file is not read by the app.
